<title>UK: DSL Finance sets 250 mln mark September 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 09:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>DSL Finance sets 250 mln mark September 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 09:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    29.SEP.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.848   PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.998    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from 101.833 and reoffer price from 99.983.)</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS DE/NL/UK/US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT BUND DUE SEPT 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
